Z||000003||Banzai||11-16-2001||12:45 PM||||I used DEIs' Cool Mat. I made a cardboard template for the firewall and part of the side panels, transferred the design to the Cool Mat and fastened it by drilling holes and using the push in fastners provided(I bought and used a few more for a better hold)<BR>It looks great.<P>Banzai !!!!!!!!!<P>" I promise honey, it'll be done in one MORE week--------"||||reg||1
